397	/** The sheet's pools, in the order they were added, each with its members in the order they were added. A member
398	 *  with a retirement date set (whatever the date) counts its share toward the pool's total, as any member does. A pool that is a member of none has the sheet's pot; a pool that is a member of another has
399	 *  its cut in that pool as its pot (none when that pool has no cuts). Each member of a balanced pool, when it has a
